<title>USA: PSE to trade SITEL options from Feb 18.</title>
<headline>PSE to trade SITEL options from Feb 18.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange said Wednesday it would start trading options on shares of SITEL Corp on February 18.</p>
<p>The exchange said opening strike prices would be at 17-1/2, 20 and 22-1/2, with expirations in March, April, July and October.</p>
<p>Position limits of 7,500 contracts have been set.</p>
<p>SITEL shares slipped 1/4 to 17-1/2 Wednesday.</p>
<p>The options have been allocated to lead market makers Michael Cole and Paul Roesler, the PSE said.</p>
<p>((Derivatives desk, 3124088750/Email: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
